来源: immortalwrt/immortalwrt package/kernel/r8168/patches/001-r8168_n-fix-proc_dump_rx_desc_2-on-32-bits.patch
(飞牛的 r8168.ko 带有该补丁的行为, 见笔记 step14-extmod-net.md)

